      "role": "Top navigation bar items",
      "description": "Neue Haas Grotesk 14px, weight 500, Obsidian text. 8px vertical padding, 12px horizontal padding. No visible border or background. Sits directly on the white nav bar with 16px gaps between items. The 'Sign Up' variant is a filled black pill with white text."
