      "role": "Emphasized words within body copy",
      "description": "Body text (16px Neue Haas Grotesk 400) with selected words wrapped in a Cotton Candy (#ffb4ed) background fill. The highlight extends slightly beyond the text bounds (2-4px padding) with no radius. This is the editorial 'marker pen' effect — it makes key phrases scannable without changing text color."
