      "name": "Elevated Card",
      "role": "Content cards for features, pricing, and data panels",
      "description": "Paper (#ffffff) background, 6px border-radius, 1px Concrete (#e5e7eb) border, 24px padding. Optional multi-layer soft shadow (45px/68px spread at 1% opacity, cascading to 3px/4px at 4% opacity) for cards that need to float above the canvas. Zero or minimal shadow for cards on flat sections."
